MzczMDEwNzM4","editor":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDgwNA==","url":"https://github.com/greggman","login":"greggman"}},"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Maybe you have different experience. In games I've rarely worked on a project that used depthWrite = false except for particles effects. It's extremely common to enable gl.BLEND for things like leaves and grass and use an alpha test discard and the depth test has to be on for it work. I'm sure there are a ton more scenes that will break where in three.js terms it needs to be (depthWrite = true, transparency = true, alphaTest = \u003e 0) but unfortunately most of the scenes that would show this are not downloadable from sketchfab\r\n\r\n![wjwiGLP8Uo](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263627-4af9f880-999e-11ea-8b8c-fdf474709257.gif)\r\n![KttvBSkioM](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263637-4e8d7f80-999e-11ea-886d-f9aad8471db0.gif)\r\n![8BtBhCpOLr](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263651-53523380-999e-11ea-8059-2668d1e97b47.gif)\r\n![yTiAxZYKVd](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263659-55b48d80-999e-11ea-8595-a7893c3bdefc.gif)\r\n![qU9P1XwPXH](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263662-577e5100-999e-11ea-919f-789a3af6ce5e.gif)\r\n![WaJe6EwygL](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/234804/82263665-59e0ab00-999e-11ea-98b6-16afe3dc7eb2.gif)\r\n","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMaybe you have different experience. In games I've rarely worked on a project that used depthWrite = false except for particles effects. It's extremely common to enable gl.BLEND for things like leaves and grass and use an alpha test discard and the depth test has to be on for it work. I'm sure there are a ton more scenes that will break where in three.js terms it needs to be (depthWrite = true, transparency = true, alphaTest = \u0026gt; 0) but unfortunately most of the scenes that would show this are not downloadable from sketchfab\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp di