iner__W96yO7"><span class="prc-Label-Label-qG-Zu" data-size="small" data-variant="secondary" data-testid="comment-author-association" aria-label="This user has been invited to collaborate on the three.js repository." aria-describedby="_R_8q6ge5gutkr85_" data-component="Label">Collaborator</span></div><div class="ActionsButtonsContainer__ZaEPJ0"><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" aria-label="Actions for donmccurdy&#x27;s comment, 4:12 PM on October 10, 2019" data-testid="comment-header-hamburger" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk CommentActionsIconButton__rdmp8b prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="small" data-variant="invisible" aria-describedby="_R_fja6ge5gutkr85_" id="_R_ja6ge5gutkr85_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-kebab-horizontal" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M8 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3ZM1.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Zm13 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z"></path></svg></button><span class="prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="n" data-component="Tooltip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true" id="_R_fja6ge5gutkr85_">More actions</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Body__scgEjp IssueCommentBody__DGWd7U"><div data-testid="markdown-body" data-team-hovercards-enabled="true" class="markdown-body" data-turbolinks="false"><div class="markdown-body safe-html-box__Uwc6Al"><blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Currently, we are letting depthWrite: true for every material that is being loaded from GLTFLoader.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">I think we came to the conclusion that <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="315369405" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/13889" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mrdoob/three.js/issues/13889/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/13889">#13889</a> was a modeling issue. Can you give other examples of models that require <code class="notranslate">depthWrite: true</code>? My impression is that without it, we handle transparency correctly roughly as often as babylonjs, although either may succeed and fail in different situations.</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">And glTF spec does not specify how we must set our depth write, even in non-normative sections, since the use of glTF is not restricted to the traditional realtime rasterizer.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">glTF files are meant to be renderable by realtime rasterizers, but even with that, I'm not sure whether it's true that a majority of implementations set <code class="notranslate">depthWrite: false</code> for models with the "BLEND" alpha mode.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto">I'm OK with considering a change here, but (1) I don't know whether <code class="notranslate">depthWrite: false</code> is the right change, as opposed to (for example) a different sorting algorithm, and (2) if there is a change I don't think it should be in GLTFLoader alone. The glTF format does not specify depthWrite for alpha transparency because we don't think there's a single correct/consensus answer. GLTFLoader uses three.js defaults to be consistent with user expectations, so if we change anything here, it should probably be the three.js defaults – there's nothing particularly different about alpha transparency in glTF vs FBX, the same limitations apply.</p></div></div><div role="toolbar" aria-label="Reactions" class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap"><div class="ReactionPopoverAnchor__B84pko"><button data-component="Button" type="button" aria-label="👍 1 reaction" role="switch" aria-checked="false" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk reactionToggleButton__j2dnln" data-inactive="true" data-loading="false" data-size="small" data-variant="default" aria-describedby="_R_1mqge5gutkr85_ _R_1mqge5gutkr85H2_"><span data-component="buttonContent" data-align="center" class="prc-Button-ButtonContent-Iohp5"><span data-component="leadingVisual" class="prc-Button-Visual-YNt2F prc-Button-LeadingVisual-UySKu prc-Button-VisualWrap-E4cnq">👍</span><span data-component="text" class="prc-Button-Label-FWkx3"><span class="sr-only" id="_R_1mqge5gutkr85_">React with 👍</span>1</span></span></button><span class="sr-only" id="_R_1mqge5gutkr85H2_">Reacted by <!-- -->影月 零</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li data-timeline-event-id="MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI3MDMzMzkzNzQ=" data-highlighted-event="false" data-testid="timeline-row-border-MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI3MDMzMzkzNzQ=" data-wrapper-timeline-id="MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI3MDMzMzkzNzQ=" class="Timeline_Item__SPOwOL Timeline_Item_inlineAvatars__agUydM Timeline_Item_indent__x6ciCp Timeline_Item_groupStart__5RUdLa rowIn